{{~##
   A single self-contained C++17 header.

   Indentation is literal, and has to match what the printer this replaced produced,
   because the golden trees compare the output byte for byte. Control lines carry the
   whitespace-stripping tilde so they contribute nothing of their own.

   Anything needing the model - a read call, a default, an escaped name - arrives
   already rendered from CppView.

   Note for anyone editing: a literal closing brace pair inside a comment ends the
   comment, which is how this one first leaked four lines into every generated header.
##~}}
